Vocab Garden word data
======================

The files in this folder are adapted from the New General Service List (NGSL) 1.2.

New General Service List by Browne, C., Culligan, B., and Phillips, J. is licensed under a Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License.

- NGSL source: https://www.newgeneralservicelist.com/new-general-service-list
- License: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

This adapted data is also licensed under the Creative Commons
Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License (CC BY-SA 4.0):
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/

Vocab Garden is not an official NGSL product and is not endorsed by the
NGSL authors.

Changes made to the NGSL
------------------------

- Grouped the words into levels of 100 words by NGSL frequency rank
  (level 28 holds ranks 2,701-2,809) plus one level for the 52 NGSL
  supplementary words (ranks written as S1-S52 in file order).
- Combined the rank from "NGSL 1.2 with basic statistics" with the word
  forms from "NGSL 1.2 alphabetized and lemmatized for teaching".
- Used the headword "I" as written in the statistics file (the teaching
  file writes "i").
- Added Thai meanings, parts of speech, original example sentences with
  Thai translations, and usage notes.
- Added frequency.tsv: the "Adjusted Frequency per Million" value of each
  ranked word, copied from "NGSL 1.2 with basic statistics" (used only to
  see frequency ranking, e.g. to estimate text coverage).
- Added extra/NN.tsv (levels 1-4): original second example sentences with
  Thai translations and common word combinations (collocations) for the
  words of those levels.
- Added confusables.json: original explanations and practice sentences for
  pairs of NGSL words that learners often confuse (all words are NGSL 1.2
  headwords).

The full history of changes is recorded in CHANGELOG.md under
"ข้อมูลคำศัพท์" (word data).

